      "items": [
        "Distinction between Khadar (new, highly fertile alluvium) and Bhangar (old alluvium containing calcareous Kankar deposits) is a high-yield exam topic.",
        "Black soil exhibits a 'self-ploughing' characteristic because it shrinks and develops deep cracks when dry, absorbing moisture effectively upon wetting.",
